      "id": "sol.ahsme-1984-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Factoring the denominator gives \\[ \\begin{aligned} 252^2-248^2 &=(252+248)\\\\ &\\quad{}\\cdot(252-248)\\\\ &=500\\cdot4=2000. \\end{aligned} \\] Thus the given quotient is \\(\\frac{1000^2}{2000}=500.\\) Therefore, the correct answer is C.",
